== melonking manifesto
<melonking-manifesto>
Discovered 4/28/2025

https:/\/melonking.net/thoughts/manifesto

#divider()

Manifesto of a web revival netizen. There are some really good quotes here.

The #link("https://wiki.melonland.net/web_revival")[web revival movement] harkens back to the old web1.0 days, when the internet was new, weird, unstructured, and personal. Navigating through this website feels like exploring a children's museum - not as a parent, but as a child. It's whimsical, fantastic, and genuinely technically impressive at times.

#quote(
  block: true,
)[All creation is defiance, what came before was created, you must defy it to make something new, and then you must defy yourself to make something new again.]

#quote(
